cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use IR-Toolbox, please cite it as below."
title: "IR-Toolbox — جعبه ابزار آفلاین فارسی"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source (MIT), offline-first Progressive Web App with 52
  privacy-first Persian (Farsi) web tools in 9 categories: text, developer,
  design, files, math, time and Jalali calendar, security (AES-256-GCM vault
  and password manager with PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA-256 at 600,000 iterations), fun
  and brain games. Everything runs 100% locally in the browser — no server,
  no database, no tracking. Version 1.3.7 hardened the app further: a strict
  Content-Security-Policy on every page, no eval/new Function anywhere (the
  scientific calculator uses a recursive-descent parser), the regex tester
  runs in a Web Worker with an 800 ms kill switch, and CSV export is guarded
  against formula injection (CWE-1236).
